<title>ESTONIA: Estonian trade deficit stable in November.</title>
<headline>Estonian trade deficit stable in November.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The trade deficit of the Baltic state of Estonia was stable at 1.5 billion kroons in November, unchanged from the previous month, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN TRADE BALANCE    Nov '96     Oct '96     Nov '95</p>
<p> Exports			 2.66	  2.5	   2.10</p>
<p> Imports			 4.16	  4.0	   2.91</p>
<p> Balance			 -1.5	  -1.5	  -806</p>
<p>NOTE -- All figures are billions of kroons unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>MAJOR TRADING PARTNERS IN NOVEMBER</p>
<p>Imports (percent share) Finland 28.8, Russia 15.8, Germany 9.4 Exports (percent share) Finland 17.4, Russia 16.0, Sweden 13.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
